WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.270 --> 00:00:05.540
Are you a good driver and you always follow
safe driving habits? Do you maintain your

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:10.440
car's health like brakes and engine oil very
well? You can now get rewarded for that and

00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:15.290
pay less premium on your car insurance. You
can do this with 'Pay As You Drive' or 'Pay

00:00:15.290 --> 00:00:20.950
How You Use' policy which is introduced now
in India. In this video, I will explain how

00:00:20.950 --> 00:00:26.280
to reduce your car insurance costs every year
using this new type of car insurance called

00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:30.039
'Pay As You Drive' or 'Pay How You Use' insurance
policy.

00:00:30.039 --> 00:00:47.390
Welcome to Save 
and Invest Smartly!

00:00:47.390 --> 00:00:52.320
The 'Pay As You Drive' policy is a part of
the sandbox initiative, where insurers can

00:00:52.320 --> 00:00:58.180
experiment and test innovative financial products.
The sandbox approach gives an opportunity

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:03.300
to experiment and learn about new technology
and product, before it’s finally adopted

00:01:03.300 --> 00:01:08.590
and offered to larger set of people. The insurance
company that has rolled out 'Pay As You Drive'

00:01:08.590 --> 00:01:12.630
insurance policy is ICICI Lombard General
Insurance.

00:01:12.630 --> 00:01:14.889
What is Pay As You Drive Insurance?

00:01:14.889 --> 00:01:19.719
This is a telematics based car insurance for
which the premium is calculated based on how

00:01:19.719 --> 00:01:25.789
you drive. That is, the premium for this insurance
policy is calculated based your driving behavior.

00:01:25.789 --> 00:01:30.109
The insurance companies understand that there
is less risk when good driving behavior is

00:01:30.109 --> 00:01:35.860
adopted and are ready to reward them by giving
discounts on the premium. So if you drive

00:01:35.860 --> 00:01:41.279
better and safer, then your premium will be
far lesser than that of traditional insurance

00:01:41.279 --> 00:01:42.509
policies.

00:01:42.509 --> 00:01:45.959
What is telematics?
Telematics is a device that will be installed

00:01:45.959 --> 00:01:51.630
in your car to track how you drive and analyze
if you have maintained safe speed, efficient

00:01:51.630 --> 00:01:53.560
mileage and smooth driving.

00:01:53.560 --> 00:01:58.679
How is the Sum Insured calculated?
Every vehicle has an IDV - Insured Declared

00:01:58.679 --> 00:02:04.700
Value, fixed by the insurer based on the brand,
model and age of the vehicle. It may be approximately

00:02:04.700 --> 00:02:09.610
equivalent to the market value of the vehicle.
For example, let us consider you own a

00:02:09.610 --> 00:02:14.510
car. There will be a market value for your
car as per the model, age of the car, etc.

00:02:14.510 --> 00:02:18.080
IDV is approximately equivalent to the market
value.

00:02:18.080 --> 00:02:22.030
Hence if the market value of your car
is 500000, then the sum insured that you will

00:02:22.030 --> 00:02:24.420
get on the insurance is Rs. 500000.

00:02:24.420 --> 00:02:28.780
How is the insurance premium calculated?
Initial premium is arrived at based on

00:02:28.780 --> 00:02:33.010
your age, driving experience and the safety
features in the car.

00:02:33.010 --> 00:02:37.050
You may pay the premium only for the first
quarter to start with. Your driving score

00:02:37.050 --> 00:02:41.140
will be calculated every quarter and premium
will be revised accordingly.

00:02:41.140 --> 00:02:45.240
If you maintain good and safe driving
habits, your driving score will increase and

00:02:45.240 --> 00:02:48.190
hence the quarterly premium will become lesser.

00:02:48.190 --> 00:02:52.070
What are the Coverage Options available?
You may choose any of the 2 coverage options

00:02:52.070 --> 00:02:52.926
available.

00:02:52.926 --> 00:02:56.180
Option 1: Stand Alone Own Damage Cover

00:02:56.180 --> 00:03:02.340
Own Damage Insurance&nbsp;is a customized motor&nbsp;insurance&nbsp;policy
designed to protect you and your insured vehicle

00:03:02.340 --> 00:03:07.110
from your&nbsp;own damages. That is, this policy
covers against any loss or damage to your

00:03:07.110 --> 00:03:12.690
vehicle or its accessories due to:&nbsp;
1. Fire, explosion, self-ignition, accidental

00:03:12.690 --> 00:03:15.690
damage
2. Transit, that is when the vehicle is shifted

00:03:15.690 --> 00:03:19.580
from one place to another
3. Natural disasters like earthquake, flood,

00:03:19.580 --> 00:03:23.290
cyclone, etc.
4. Burglary, theft, riot, etc.,

00:03:23.290 --> 00:03:27.900
Option 2: Own Damage with Third Party
This option covers everything in Option 1

00:03:27.900 --> 00:03:31.819
plus the third party coverage.
Third party policy&nbsp;covers the&nbsp;insured&nbsp;against

00:03:31.819 --> 00:03:37.140
any legal liability arising out towards third
parties due to accidental injury or death

00:03:37.140 --> 00:03:40.940
of a person and any damage caused to third
party property.

00:03:40.940 --> 00:03:43.940
Lets see the Advantages of 'Pay As You Drive'
Insurance policy

00:03:43.940 --> 00:03:49.060
You will pay low premiums if your driving
is good. That is if you drive safely, then

00:03:49.060 --> 00:03:54.150
your driving score improves and premium decreases.
A Free telematics device is provided to

00:03:54.150 --> 00:03:58.260
you to track your car's health and your driving
patterns. The insurance company will help

00:03:58.260 --> 00:04:01.000
in installing this telematics device to your
car.

00:04:01.000 --> 00:04:05.000
A telematics mobile app can be installed
in your mobile, so that you can track your

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:10.010
car's health, your driving score, weekly summary
of driving behavior, etc.

00:04:10.010 --> 00:04:14.460
You will also get periodic tips to improve
your driving based on your driving score.

00:04:14.460 --> 00:04:18.849
In future, this type of insurance can revolutionize
the vehicle insurance world.

00:04:18.849 --> 00:04:23.289
If lets say, you are meeting with an accident,
then the telematics device can automatically

00:04:23.289 --> 00:04:28.509
detect the accident and trigger alerts to
police and ambulance attaching your GPS location

00:04:28.509 --> 00:04:31.239
details. This can make the rescue operation
faster.

00:04:31.239 --> 00:04:35.539
The telematics can also send alert to
the insurer for road-side assistance and claim

00:04:35.539 --> 00:04:38.039
processing.
By giving continuous feedback to drivers

00:04:38.039 --> 00:04:42.850
about their driving habits, it will create
good and responsible drivers thereby reducing

00:04:42.850 --> 00:04:43.850
the accidents.

00:04:43.850 --> 00:04:46.759
How to apply for 'Pay As You Drive' policy?

00:04:46.759 --> 00:04:50.740
If you want to get the insurance from ICICI
Lombard General Insurance,

00:04:50.740 --> 00:04:56.270
visit www.icicilombard.com. You will see
various menu options.

00:04:56.270 --> 00:05:00.120
Click on Products and then select the
option "Pay As You Drive".

00:05:00.120 --> 00:05:04.309
You may scroll through the page and understand
the features of this new policy.

00:05:04.309 --> 00:05:08.909
Currently ICICI Lombard has made this
policy available to only those who are already

00:05:08.909 --> 00:05:13.949
on a telematics based policy like 'Pay As
You Use'. Hence if you already have 'Pay As

00:05:13.949 --> 00:05:17.340
You Use' you may contact the insurer and add
this option.

00:05:17.340 --> 00:05:20.689
In future I hope, this type will be extended
to new applicants as well.

00:05:20.689 --> 00:05:25.569
The 'Pay As You Drive' policy will definitely
save you money on your car insurance if your

00:05:25.569 --> 00:05:30.699
maintain good and safe driving habits. Give
it a try when you apply or renew your car

00:05:30.699 --> 00:05:35.199
insurance next time. Let me know your thoughts
on this new policy type in the comments section.

00:05:35.199 --> 00:05:37.729
Also, write down if you have more queries
on this.

